         legacy object only advances var (0..3, zero page) and flips REWARD at var==4 (zero page); the
         claim (10002 -> 5 -> end dialog) lives on Dewi 204777, the journal's reward row. The old XML
         registered the object as NPC_START/NPC_REPORT/npc-complete, all of which send pages (4762/10002
         and the SELECT_QUEST tail with questId=0) to a dialog-less object -> client load fail. The
         ladder below keeps the counting with zero pages (cf. quest 1612) and confines completion to
         Dewi. -->
